{"id":"n62330-1-4","stage":3,"title":"지치다 · 疲惫","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62330-1-4-1","ko":"요즘은 조금만 일을 해도 지쳐.","zh":"最近哪怕只工作一会儿就会觉得累。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"요즘은","meaning":"最近，近来，这阵子","explanation":"요즘：最近，近来，这阵子；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20250","senseId":"1","lemma":"요즘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"조금만","meaning":"片刻，一会儿","explanation":"조금：片刻，一会儿；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"조금","audio":"/audio/b4049b7414b62d9bee5d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61176","senseId":"2","lemma":"조금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"일을","meaning":"事情，工作","explanation":"일：事情，工作；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"1","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"해도","meaning":"表示“但是”、“因为那样”、“那么”、“因此”、“所以”的意思。","explanation":"하다：表示“但是”、“因为那样”、“那么”、“因此”、“所以”的意思。；어도：表示让步：“即使、就算”；-아/어도 되다 表示“可以”。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"32","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"지쳐.","meaning":"疲惫，疲乏，疲劳","explanation":"지치다：疲惫，疲乏，疲劳；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"지치다","audio":"/audio/895ef8ad4cdb0b0bcd6e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62330","senseId":"1","lemma":"지치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"828c4030dd68aa7b","term":"요즘","zh":"最近，近来，这阵子","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3","entryId":"20250","definition":"从非常近的过去到现在之间。","pronunciation":["요즘"]},{"id":"b4049b7414b62d9b","term":"조금","zh":"片刻，一会儿","audio":"/audio/b4049b7414b62d9bee5d.mp3","entryId":"61176","definition":"短暂时间。","pronunciation":["조금"]},{"id":"dfc76879e2f5c3ea","term":"일","zh":"事情，工作","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3","entryId":"91895","definition":"为了实现某事而使用身体或精神的活动；或指该活动的对象。","pronunciation":["일ː"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示“但是”、“因为那样”、“那么”、“因此”、“所以”的意思。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"表示“但是”、“因为那样”、“那么”、“因此”、“所以”的意思。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"895ef8ad4cdb0b0b","term":"지치다","zh":"疲惫，疲乏，疲劳","audio":"/audio/895ef8ad4cdb0b0bcd6e.mp3","entryId":"62330","definition":"做吃力的工作或受困于某事而没有力气。","pronunciation":["지ː치다"]}],"audio":"/audio/ce8af1d4e2f235bf27eb.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62330-1-4-2","ko":"보약이라도 먹어야 되는 거 아냐?","zh":"是不是该吃点补药啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"보약이라도","meaning":"补药","explanation":"보약：补药；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；라도：表示让步或假定：“即使是、就算是”。","readings":[{"term":"보약","audio":"/audio/c8b0880ea87e722f034a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59306","senseId":"1","lemma":"보약","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"먹어야","meaning":"服，吃","explanation":"먹다：服，吃；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"3","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"되는","meaning":"应该、必须（-아/어야 되다）","explanation":"되다：应该、必须（-아/어야 되다）；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"20","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아냐?","meaning":"知道，明白","explanation":"알다：知道，明白；냐：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"알다","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89445","senseId":"1","lemma":"알다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"c8b0880ea87e722f","term":"보약","zh":"补药","audio":"/audio/c8b0880ea87e722f034a.mp3","entryId":"59306","definition":"增强体内元气、有助于健康的药。","pronunciation":["보ː약"]},{"id":"9639f892bdddb53f","term":"먹다","zh":"服，吃","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3","entryId":"58272","definition":"将药物放进口中并咽下。","pronunciation":["먹따"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"应该、必须（-아/어야 되다）","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"应该、必须（-아/어야 되다）","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]},{"id":"4646a3463436c8a4","term":"알다","zh":"知道，明白","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3","entryId":"89445","definition":"通过教育、经验、思考等来，具备与事物或情况相关的信息或知识。","pronunciation":["알ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/5048f025970e3444751e.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.87,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=62330","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":97,"sequenceScore":2.5953,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["是不是该吃点补药啊？","最近哪怕只工作一会儿就会觉得累。","你的大腿好红啊，是长什么东西了吗？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["最近哪怕只工作一会儿就会觉得累。","你的大腿好红啊，是长什么东西了吗？","是不是该吃点补药啊？"],"answer":2}]}
